		{
			"id": "AGF47gFlgdv9cGoDI",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 3, DX 8, IQ 7, HT 9, HP 3, WILL 7, PER 7, FP 9, SPEED 4.25, MOVE 4, DODGE 7, DR —. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AzD-QJ7iYjx1-Gs3k",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense -7, protection -13), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "Afkds883pMwn8EkW8",
			"text": "Whirlpool (1d crushing), reach 4 yards: When on or in a body of water, the elemental can create a whirlpool effect with itself at the center, affecting anything within 32 yards of its position. Roll 7d as for crushing damage, determine knockback, and then double the distance; however, the victim suffers no actual damage from the effect – just the consequences of being hurled around. As a special effect, knockback from this moves victims sideways (all clockwise or all anticlockwise; decide when triggering the attack) rather than away from the elemental."
		},
